artifacts/

# personal documentation
*private*.md
# Build-time generated SayIt icon derivatives (canonical source is icons/sayit.svg)
icons/sayit.ico
icons/sayit-*.png
icons/sayit.png

# Build-time Linux runtime dependency generated by scripts/vendor_portaudio.py
src/sayit/_vendor/linux/libportaudio.so*
